WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 4337ebde4211229fd7b4cd40d884c2bb

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.100
Karibu tena. Sawa, hii ni video fupi.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.840
Hadi sasa, kila ulipotumia repeat kitanzi,

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.050
umekuwa ukibainisha namba inayosema

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.930
ni mara ngapi kurudia. Rudia mara tano,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.080
mara 10, mara 40. Wakati mwingine umetumia

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.800
variable kufanya hivi pia. Lakini siku zote

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.860
umemwambia Jiki hasa ni mara ngapi arudie

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.880
kitanzi. Hata hivyo, wakati mwingine hatujui

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.370
mapema ni mara ngapi tutarudia. Fikiri kuhusu

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.330
labirinthi. Huko mwanzoni mwa

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.980
kozi hii, ulitatua labirinthi kwa

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.740
kuandika miondoko maalum. Uliweza kuona

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.240
labirinthi, kuhesabu hatua, na kuandika idadi

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.500
sahihi ya miondoko. Lakini vipi kama nikisema,

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.120
"Niandikie msimbo unaoweza kutatua

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.980
labirinthi yoyote nitakayokupa"? Inaweza kuhitaji

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.640
hatua 10, au 50, au 200. Hujui

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.800
kabisa mapema. Kwa hiyo unahitaji

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.330
njia ya kumwambia Jiki aendelee tu.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.100
Endelea kuangalia ni njia gani unaweza

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:04.260
kuchukua, endelea kufanya maamuzi, endelea kusonga mbele, tena

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.780
na tena mpaka umalize. Na njia

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.039
ya kufanya hivyo ni rahisi sana. Usiweke

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.200
namba kwenye keyword ya repeat. Acha

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:17.580
mabano hayo wazi tu. Ukifanya hivi, Jiki

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.800
ataendelea tu mpaka kitu kingine

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.440
kimwambie asimame. Baadaye,

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.660
tutaangalia hivyo vitu vingine ni nini.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.560
Lakini kwa sasa, ataendelea tu mpaka

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.560
zoezi litakapomalizika, au mpaka aamue

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.560
kuwa amekuwa akienda kwa muda mrefu sana, anataka

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.140
kupumzika, na kuamua kuwa amechoka kabisa. Katika

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:38.420
zoezi linalofuata, utatatua kwa kweli

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.480
labirinthi hii ipasavyo. Utaandika msimbo unaomwezesha

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.540
kiumbe chako kidogo kupata njia kupitia

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.300
labirinthi yoyote, bila kujali mpangilio wake.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:49.340
Maagizo yatakupa kanuni ya kufuata.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.840
Kazi yako ni kugeuza maagizo hayo, yaani

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.800
kanuni (algorithm), neno la kitaalamu la orodha

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:57.580
ya maagizo, kuwa msimbo ukitumia vitanzi vya

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.300
repeat, if, else if, na kadhalika.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.560
Furahia, na tutaonana

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:02.920
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
